# shadcn + Tailwind guardrails

- Styling is **Tailwind + shadcn only**.
- **Do not edit** `src/components/ui/*` directly for customization. Customize via:
  - wrappers in `src/components/**`
  - composition (preferred)
  - theme/tokens in `src/index.css`
- Use semantic tokens (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, etc.), avoid raw colors unless unavoidable.

